 of 【Tactics】 at the start of own turn (each stack restores 4% Qi at turn end, lasting 1 turn). During the turn, each time a Special Card or Recovery Card is used on self or an ally, consume 1 stack of 【Tactics】 and grant the target the 【Assault Tactic】 status (target Attack increases by 10%, max 2 stacks, lasting 1 turn.)"}}],"debateSouls":[],"soulPoints":{"war":3200,"battle":1000,"debate":6200},"equipment":[{"id":"WP1007102","name":{"zh":"竹简","en":"Bamboo Slip"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"与木简一样用来记载文字的竹简，竹简在南方更为常见。","en":"Bamboo slips used for writing like wooden slips, more common in the south."},"atkVal":"3","hp":"110","mp":"160","price":"2000","slot":{"zh":"武器","en":"Weapon"}},{"id":"WP1017005","name":{"zh":"蜀锦长衣","en":"Shu Brocade Coat"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"选用了益州特有的面料并进行了纹饰处理的长袍，衣服的边缘处也添加了简单的纹饰。","en":"A long robe made from fabric unique to Yi Province and adorned with patterns, with simple motifs also added along the edges."},"defenceVal":"3","hp":"550","mp":"550","price":"7200","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1025705","name":{"zh":"青云纶巾","en":"Azure Cloud Turban"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"采用了特殊布料的纶巾，更为轻巧透气。","en":"A silk kerchief made from special cloth, lighter and more breathable."},"defenceVal":"3","mp":"1200","price":"5000","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{"father":{"label":{"zh":"父亲","en":"Father"},"people":[{"id":"WJ1036915","code":"0"}]},"family":{"label":{"zh":"亲属","en":"Relatives"},"people":[{"id":"WJ1037015","code":"100"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI115015","name":{"zh":"颍川庾氏","en":"The Yu Clan of Yingchuan"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自颛顼高阳氏，以官名为氏。上古周朝管理粮仓的官职称“庾廪”，子孙以官为氏。两汉时期形成颍川、新野两大郡望，颍川庾氏是其中最大支派。家族兴起于东汉桓帝时期，庾乘受名士郭泰赏识，由县衙看门小吏被拔擢入学，后能讲论经义，朝廷屡次征辟而不应，时称“庾征君”。入曹魏后，庾乘出任襄城县令，其子庾嶷、庾遁两代人以通晓经学奠定家族门望。家族从庾遁一支发展最为兴盛，庾峻、庾纯在西晋皆为侍中、儒宗，庾纯更以敢于质问权臣贾充“高贵乡公何在”而闻名。东晋时，庾遁曾孙庾亮以外戚身份辅政，与王导共同执政，推动颍川庾氏进入鼎盛期。","en":"Descended from the Gaoyang clan of Emperor Zhuanxu, taking their surname from an official post. In the ancient Zhou dynasty, officers managing granaries bore the title ‘Yulin,’ and their descendants adopted the office as their surname. During the Han dynasties, two major seats formed in Yingchuan and Xinye, with the Yu clan of Yingchuan being the prominent branch. The family rose during the reign of Emperor Huan of the Eastern Han: Yu Cheng caught the eye of the famed scholar Guo Tai, advancing from a humble gatekeeper at the County Yamen to pursue classical learning, he went on to lecture eloquently on the classics, repeatedly declining imperial summons to office and earning the moniker ‘Master Yu the Summoned.’ Upon the founding of Cao Wei, Yu Cheng served as Magistrate of Xiangcheng, while his sons Yu Yi and Yu Dun consolidated the clan's reputation over two generations through classical mastery. The family flourished most through Yu Dun's line: in the Western Jin, Yu Jun and Yu Chun both served as Commandants and Confucian masters, with Yu Chun renowned for boldly confronting the regent Jia Chong with the query, ‘Where is the Duke of Gaoguixiang?’ In the Eastern Jin, Yu Dun's great-grandson Yu Liang governed as imperial consort-regent alongside Wang Dao, ushering the Yu clan of Yingchuan into its zenith."},"talent":{"military":"1","commerce":"4","politics":"8"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":{"name":"庾嶷","height":"较矮","shape":"一般"},"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[35,25,74,78,70,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1025705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026",