action":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[35,25,74,78,70,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1025705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[35,25,74,78,70,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1025705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[35,25,74,78,70,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1025705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[35,25,74,78,70,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1025705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1016","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[35,25,74,78,70,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1025705"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东汉名士，庾乘之子。魏文帝黄初年间，庾嶷以议郎的身份，参与了由司空陈群、散骑常侍刘邵等人主持的《新律》十八篇的制定工作。到魏齐王曹芳正始年间，官至太仆卿。其侄庾峻在《晋书》本传中评价庾嶷中正简素。其子庾䨹入晋后官至尚书，封阳翟子。","tc":"東漢名士，庾乘之子。魏文帝黃初年間，庾嶷以議郎的身份，參與了由司空陳群、散騎常侍劉邵等人主持的《新律》十八篇的制定工作。到魏齊王曹芳正始年間，官至太仆卿。其侄庾峻在《晉書》本傳中評價庾嶷中正簡素。其子庾䨹入晉后官至尚書，封陽翟子。","en":"A renowned scholar of the Eastern Han and son of Yu Cheng. During the Huangchu era of Emperor Wen of Wei, Yu Yi, serving as Consultant, took part in drafting the eighteen chapters of the New Code overseen by Chief Minister Chen Qun, Cavalier Attendant Liu Shao, and others. By the Zhengshi era of Cao Fang, Prince of Qi, he had risen to Chief Secretary. In his biography in the Book of Jin, his nephew Yu Jun praised Yu Yi as upright, simple, and unpretentious. His son Yu Yu served Jin as Master of Writing and was enfeoffed as Viscount of Yangzhai.","jp":"後漢の名士・庾乗の子。魏の文帝の黄初年間、庾嶷は議郎として、司空の陳羣や散騎常侍の劉劭らが主導した『新律』十八篇の制定に加わった。魏の斉王曹芳の正始年間には、官位は太僕卿にまで至った。甥の庾峻は『晋書』の本伝において庾嶷を「中正簡素」と評している。子の庾䨹は晋の時代に尚書に至り、陽翟子に封じられた。","kr":"동한의 명사이자 유승의 아들이다. 위 문제 황초 연간, 유억은 의랑의 신분으로 사공 진군, 산기상시 유소 등이 주도한 《신률》 18편 제정에 참여했다. 위 제왕 조방 정시 연간에는 관직이 태복경에 이르렀다. 조카 유준은 《진서》 본전에서 유억을 두고 중정하고 검소하다(中正簡素)고 평했다. 아들 유묵은 진나라에 출사하여 관직이 상서에 이르렀고 양적자에 봉해졌다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1037115","remark":"","surname":"庾","surnameTc":"庾","surnameEn":"Yu","surnameJp":"庾","surnameKr":"유","surnameOther":"","name":"嶷","nameTc":"嶷","nameEn":"Yi","nameJp":"嶷","nameKr":"억","nameOther":"","word":"邵然","wordTc":"邵然","wordEn":"Shaoran","wordJp":"邵然","wordKr":"소연","wordOther":"","icon":"庾嶷","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"0","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"223","city":"CS1026","gender":"0","rule":"35","force":"25","wise":"74","politics":"78","charm":"70","will":"65","ruleTalent":"5","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"10","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"10/10/10/10/10/83/32/10","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1008101","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1015605","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"3200","battleSoulPoint":"1000","debateSoulPoint":"6200","strategy":"1007315","strategy2":"1009701",